  _senarioImage: {fileID: 7482667652216324306, guid: af60050f15f740d4894ba5250b7c5fb3, type: 3}
  _forground: {fileID: 0}
  _senarioDescription: "You run up this unknown entity that lies under your bed and
    plunge your knife directly in what you believe to be its chest area. Letting
    out a bellowing roar, followed by intense thrashing, then finally releasing a
    blinding light. Upon opening your eyes, you see yourself lying in bed as if this
    were all a bad dream. That might have been believable if it wasnt for the silhouette
    of a body wasnt stained to the floor under your bed, leaving you with the final
    thought\u2026 has that always been there?(On the offence - Ending)"
